      "annotations": [
        "The agent submits the resource token to its PS's auth_token_endpoint, signing with its own agent token.",
        "capabilities travels in the request body: AAuth-Capabilities is not used on PS endpoints.",
        "The person, reviewing the justification at the consent screen, asks a question. The PS delivers it to the agent as 202 with requirement=clarification.",
        "The question is a Markdown string in the body; the header carries only the requirement. timeout and options are OPTIONAL body members.",
        "The same shape is used by an AS asking the PS. The PS then triages who answers: itself from mission context, the person, or the agent."
