      "annotations": [
        "The agent POSTs its answer to the pending URL. action is REQUIRED — a server MUST reject a POST with a missing or unrecognized action with 400.",
        "The three actions are clarification_response, updated_request (a new resource token with reduced scope), and DELETE to withdraw the request entirely.",
        "Clarification responses are untrusted input and MUST be sanitized before the PS displays them.",
        "PSes SHOULD cap the number of rounds; five is the recommended limit.",
        "The requirement now switches to interaction, and the agent resumes polling with GET."
      ],
      "is_response": false
    },
